            <ArticleTitle>Compact differences of weighted composition operators on the weighted Bergman spaces.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1186/s13660-016-1277-8</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this paper, we consider the compact differences of weighted composition operators on the standard weighted Bergman spaces. Some necessary and sufficient conditions for the differences of weighted composition operators to be compact are given, which extends Moorhouse's results in (J. Funct. Anal. 219:70-92, 2005).</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
